.TH LN "1" "April 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
ln \- create links between files 

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ln
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... \fI\,TARGET\/\fR \fI\,LINKNAME\/\fR

.B ln
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... \fI\,TARGET...\/\fR \fI\,DIRECTORY\/\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Create a link to TARGET with the name LINK, or create a link to TARGET in the current directory.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-f
remove existing destination files

.TP
.B \-i
prompt before overwriting files

.TP
.B \-s
create symbolic links instead of hard links

.TP
.B \-v
print the name of the linked file

